  "description": "Adam's Spray Wax - Carnauba Infused Quick Detailer Spray... - Distributed/Packaged by Adam'S Polishes. Product Details: Adam's Spray Wax - Carnauba Infused Quick Detailer Spray... - Distributed/Packaged by Adam'S Polishes. Product Details: Adam's Spray Wax - Carnauba Infused Quick Detailer Spray Polish with The Most Advanced Formula on The Market for Ultimate Protection, High Gloss & A Streak Free Finish (16 oz) - Distributed/Packaged by Adam'S Polishes. Product Details: When looking back at our product line, we wanted to have something that’s effective, that cuts time, and that simply fits a need to our customer base. We looked at possibly upgrading and improving Detail Spray, but how can you improve something that’s already perfect? We developed Spray Wax after countless requests for it and wanted to have a specific rejuvenator for our wax applications. Adam’s Spray Wax provides an extremely slick shine and glow to your vehicle’s finish and adds extended protection to your current wax or sealant. Spray Wax can be used on a Ceramic Coated vehicle, however, you’re going to want to stick to Ceramic Boost to feed the SiO2 particles more of their own chemistry. Spray wax can be used as a stand alone wax for roughly 1-2 months of protection, a drying aid, or a simple spray and wipe product after freshly polishing or claying your vehicle to protect it before a more substantial product is used.",
